# No application Kconfig options. The reader identity used to arrive here as a
# build-time string (CONFIG_ALIRO_PROV_SEED_HEX), which put a reader private key
# into every image and made the firmware unshareable. It is now per-device data
# in the settings store, typed in over the USB console in provisioning mode, so
# there is deliberately no knob left that can put a key back into a build.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
